1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,278
This is TermLink.

2
00:00:02,288 --> 00:00:07,902
Connect your phone to command-line sessions, AI conversations, and files on
Windows.

3
00:00:07,912 --> 00:00:10,905
Start by choosing an online computer.

4
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:14,544
Choose CLI and select a terminal.

5
00:00:14,554 --> 00:00:20,147
The computer creates a separate working directory, then opens your remote
command line.

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:25,478
Open the keyboard and enter a command to see the computer return its output.

7
00:00:25,488 --> 00:00:31,468
Shortcut keys make Enter, arrow keys, and common key combinations easy to
reach.

8
00:00:32,233 --> 00:00:36,048
Open the cloud menu and fit the session to your phone window.

9
00:00:36,058 --> 00:00:40,301
The terminal adjusts its rows and columns to the space available.

10
00:00:41,067 --> 00:00:46,332
When creating an AI conversation, choose from agents available on this computer.

11
00:00:46,342 --> 00:00:50,872
Create a working directory automatically or select one yourself.

12
00:00:51,633 --> 00:00:54,736
Choose the model and reasoning effort separately.

13
00:00:54,746 --> 00:00:57,673
Permission options depend on the agent.

14
00:00:57,683 --> 00:01:00,913
This example keeps approval on request.

15
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:05,069
Send a task and follow its progress and reply.

16
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:10,109
This is a real Chinese response returned through the server from the connected
computer.

17
00:01:10,867 --> 00:01:15,707
After the AI creates a file, open the file entry in the conversation.

18
00:01:15,717 --> 00:01:20,347
Preview its contents, then navigate to its folder on the computer.

19
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,115
Choose New AI Chat from the folder menu.

20
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:30,130
The current path is filled in automatically, so your next conversation starts in that
directory.

21
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:35,865
Choose the dark theme in Settings for a clear view of terminals and conversations.

22
00:01:35,875 --> 00:01:39,980
With TermLink, continue your computer work from your phone.
